/-- **`c`-slot, odd generator** — the Koszul slot on both sides.  Left:
`1 ᵍ⊗ₜ g ↦ e₄ ∈ D₃` (column `1` of `realFuseMatrix 2 1`), with sign `+1`
because the `(1,1)`-frame index is even.  Right: `1 ᵍ⊗ₜ g ↦ e₂ ∈ D₂`, then
`1 ᵍ⊗ₜ e₂ ↦ e₄ ∈ D₃`.  Both `g₃`. -/
private theorem routes_cSlot_odd :
